      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Speaker L.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, hand-authored from the article. XP ledger: level 3, power rating 5 → CR 1 as a noble. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Mastermind of the First Cohort</strong> — Liberated Toads / Pond Patrol</p><p>Status: Active — Orchestrating containment at Raventree Manor</p><p>Speaker L is no longer a naive politician. He is a ruthless, brilliant tactician who just engineered the greatest prison break in Iron Legion history. He purposefully allowed himself to be captured just to plant a virus in Aegis Command, coordinating the escape of 158 Toads. He then marched to Raventree Manor, singing a legal decree, to place Archie Miser under arrest. Waluigi is officially intimidated.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Concealed Pistol</strong> — “Speaker L has fully embraced the philosophy that institutions only respect power.”</li><li><strong>Leverage</strong> — “Somewhere between Order 120 and the barrels, Speaker L concluded that institutions do not respond to justice; they respond to leverage.”</li><li><strong>First Cohort's Mastermind</strong> — “Active — Orchestrating containment at Raventree Manor”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/speaker_l</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/speaker_l</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
